                        "review": "-very basic and slow movement\r\n-platforming and puzzles quite boring\r\n-story isn't really engaging since most of it is told in optional cutscenes and some aren't skippable\r\n-you are often forced to walk or to pet the scarf\r\n-poor performance\r\n\r\n+nice artstyle\r\n\r\nAnd to top everything off, I encountered a softlock in the desert area, due to a bug I could't feed my scarf with the orb, so I restarted the game and now I get a crash every time I try to load (of course there are no manual saves or older autosaves). So yeah, no recommendation at all...",
